
# ✨ NEON EXPERIENCE WEBSITE

Welcome to **Neon Experience** – a modern, interactive website featuring glowing neon effects, smooth animations, and an attractive dark theme.

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project is created using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It features a beautiful neon-style interface with an interactive button and glowing hover effects.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 🌟 Features

- Modern dark theme
- Neon glowing effects
- Animated hover button
- Smooth transitions
- Interactive JavaScript button
- Responsive and clean design

## 📁 Project Structure

Neon-Website/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── README.md

## 💻 How to Run

1. Download or clone this project.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.
4. Enjoy the Neon Experience!

